category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gtk-doc intltool libglib2.0-devel libsoup2.4-devel libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Natural language translation library (utilities)"
ldesc: "Libtranslate is a library for translating text and web pages
between natural languages. Its modular infrastructure allows to implement new
translation services separately from the core library."
